Apply the exact gate to AnalysisSlice: No silent row loss, duplicate join inflation, unclassified inclusion, or unsupported denominator. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
